# script-ch20.rpyc:14
translate chinese ch20_main2_b68875d5:

    # "It's an ordinary school day, like any other."
    "又是平平无奇的一天，和往常没什么两样。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:15
translate chinese ch20_main2_55a610db:

    # "Mornings are usually the worst, being surrounded by couples and friend groups walking to school together."
    "清晨通常最难熬——身边满是结伴上学的情侣和成群的朋友。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:16
translate chinese ch20_main2_cf8d9925:

    # "Meanwhile, I've always walked to school alone."
    "而我，从来都是一个人走。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:17
translate chinese ch20_main2_2848646c:

    # "I always tell myself it's about time I meet some girls or something like that..."
    "我总对自己说，是时候认识几个女孩子了……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:18
translate chinese ch20_main2_e646ec70:

    # "But I have no motivation to join any clubs."
    "可我完全没有加入社团的动力。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:19
translate chinese ch20_main2_5b22de21:

    # "I'm perfectly content just getting by on the average while spending my free time on games and anime."
    "成绩平平过得去，空闲时间打打游戏看看动画，这样的日子我挺知足。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:20
translate chinese ch20_main2_cdfda5ab:

    # "There's always the anime club, but it's not like there would be any girls in it anyway..."
    "动画社倒是个选择，但那里反正也不会有什么女生……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:25
translate chinese ch20_main2_d234f771:

    # "The school day is as ordinary as ever, and it's over before I know it."
    "学校里的一天一如既往地平淡，回过神来已经放学了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:26
translate chinese ch20_main2_7a46ab7f:

    # "After I pack up my things, I stare blankly at the wall, looking for an ounce of motivation."
    "收拾好书包后，我呆呆地望着墙壁，试图找回一丝干劲。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:27
translate chinese ch20_main2_64e92eab:

    # mc "Clubs..."
    mc "社团啊……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:28
translate chinese ch20_main2_31d6ccab:

    # "There really aren't any that interest me."
    "实在没有哪个能提得起兴趣。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:29
translate chinese ch20_main2_581d00cc:

    # "Besides, most of them would probably be way too demanding for me to want to deal with."
    "况且大多数社团八成要求一堆，我可懒得应付。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:30
translate chinese ch20_main2_aded22ad:

    # "I guess I have no choice but to start with the anime club..."
    "看来只能先从动画社开始看了……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:34
translate chinese ch20_main2_a92199a4:

    # m "...[player]?"
    m "……[player]？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:45
translate chinese ch20_main2_9a60ad41:

    # mc "...Monika?"
    mc "……莫妮卡？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:47
translate chinese ch20_main2_0fbdca71:

    # m 1b "Oh my goodness, I totally didn't expect to see you here!"
    m 1b "天哪，真没想到会在这里遇到你！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:48
translate chinese ch20_main2_a80abc6a:

    # m 5 "It's been a while, right?"
    m 5 "好久不见了呢？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:49
translate chinese ch20_main2_93deaf69:

    # mc "Ah..."
    mc "啊……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:50
translate chinese ch20_main2_62e2fb41:

    # mc "Yeah, it has."
    mc "嗯，确实好久不见了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:51
translate chinese ch20_main2_3049c3ae:

    # "Monika smiles sweetly."
    "莫妮卡露出了甜美的微笑。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:52
translate chinese ch20_main2_7c7cb783:

    # "We do know each other - well, we rarely talked, but we were in the same class last year."
    "我们确实认识——虽说几乎没说过话，但去年曾在同一个班。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:53
translate chinese ch20_main2_f583350f:

    # "Monika was probably the most popular girl in class - smart, beautiful, athletic."
    "莫妮卡大概是班里最受欢迎的女生——头脑好、长得漂亮，运动也不在话下。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:54
translate chinese ch20_main2_e3e8565d:

    # "Basically, completely out of my league."
    "总之，完全不是我高攀得起的类型。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:55
translate chinese ch20_main2_f83977c1:

    # "So, having her smile at me so genuinely feels a little..."
    "所以，被她这样真诚地微笑注视，总觉得有点……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:56
translate chinese ch20_main2_36039a80:

    # mc "What did you come in here for, anyway?"
    mc "话说，你来这间教室做什么？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:57
translate chinese ch20_main2_07a71c86:

    # m 1a "Oh, I've just been looking for some supplies to use for my club."
    m 1a "啊，我在找一些社团要用的东西。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:58
translate chinese ch20_main2_d6fe707b:

    # m 1d "Do you know if there's any construction paper in here?"
    m 1d "你知道这间教室里有没有彩色卡纸吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:59
translate chinese ch20_main2_4ed91e88:

    # m "Or markers?"
    m "或者记号笔？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:60
translate chinese ch20_main2_7793921e:

    # mc "I guess you could check the closet."
    mc "去看看柜子里有没有吧。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:61
translate chinese ch20_main2_c1339618:

    # mc "...You're in the debate club, right?"
    mc "……你现在还在辩论社吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:62
translate chinese ch20_main2_1598c2e2:

    # m 5 "Ahaha, about that..."
    m 5 "啊哈，这个嘛……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:63
translate chinese ch20_main2_e427c62a:

    # m "I actually quit the debate club."
    m "其实我退掉辩论社了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:64
translate chinese ch20_main2_e70da75f:

    # mc "Really? You quit?"
    mc "真的假的？你退社了？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:65
translate chinese ch20_main2_7e7f246d:

    # m "Yeah..."
    m "嗯……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:66
translate chinese ch20_main2_45b73312:

    # m 2e "To be honest, I can't stand all of the politics around the major clubs."
    m 2e "老实说，我受不了大型社团里那些明争暗斗。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:67
translate chinese ch20_main2_0ee5c447:

    # m "It feels like nothing but arguing about the budget and publicity and how to prepare for events..."
    m "整天就为了预算、宣传、活动筹备吵个没完……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:68
translate chinese ch20_main2_874ed9a4:

    # m "I'd much rather take something I personally enjoy and make something special out of it."
    m "我更想拿自己真正喜欢的东西，把它做成特别的存在。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:69
translate chinese ch20_main2_1ca09fe2:

    # mc "In that case, what club did you decide to join?"
    mc "那后来你加入了哪个社团？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:70
translate chinese ch20_main2_17805c80:

    # m 1b "Actually, I'm starting a new one!"
    m 1b "其实，我在创办一个新的！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:71
translate chinese ch20_main2_49f35015:

    # m "A literature club!{nw}"
    m "文学部！{nw}"

# script-ch20.rpyc:79
translate chinese ch20_main2_3faf8904:

    # m "A literature club!{fast}"
    m "文学部！{fast}"

# script-ch20.rpyc:81
translate chinese ch20_main2_a8fe5f7e:

    # mc "Literature...?"
    mc "文学……？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:82
translate chinese ch20_main2_584e99e4:

    # "That sounds kind of...dull?"
    "听起来是不是有点……无聊？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:83
translate chinese ch20_main2_49c2d156:

    # mc "How many members do you have so far?"
    mc "目前有多少成员了？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:84
translate chinese ch20_main2_1c8c1053:

    # m 5 "Um..."
    m 5 "唔……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:85
translate chinese ch20_main2_f6daf90a:

    # m "Ahaha..."
    m "啊哈……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:86
translate chinese ch20_main2_3e48ae26:

    # m "It's kind of embarrassing, but there are only three of us so far."
    m "有点不好意思说，目前只有我们三个人。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:87
translate chinese ch20_main2_3b257766:

    # m "It's really hard to find new members for something that sounds so boring..."
    m "这种听起来无聊透顶的社团，实在很难招到新成员……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:88
translate chinese ch20_main2_af2a83ac:

    # mc "Well, I can see that..."
    mc "这倒是看得出来……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:89
translate chinese ch20_main2_bc1a4311:

    # m 3d "But it's really not boring at all, you know!"
    m 3d "可它真的一点都不无聊哦！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:90
translate chinese ch20_main2_e754f821:

    # m "Literature can be anything. Reading, writing, poetry..."
    m "文学可以是任何东西。读书、写作、诗歌……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:91
translate chinese ch20_main2_c7f06a68:

    # m 3e "I mean, one of my members even keeps her manga collection in the clubroom..."
    m 3e "比如说，我有一位成员甚至把她的漫画收藏放在了活动室里……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:92
translate chinese ch20_main2_76f46bb5:

    # mc "Wait...really?"
    mc "等等……真的假的？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:93
translate chinese ch20_main2_48209ebb:

    # m 2k "Yeah, it's funny, right?"
    m 2k "嗯，很好笑对吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:94
translate chinese ch20_main2_43bd010c:

    # m 2e "She always insists that manga is literature, too."
    m 2e "她总是坚称漫画也是文学。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:95
translate chinese ch20_main2_43d75f5f:

    # m "I mean, she's not wrong, I guess..."
    m "这个嘛，倒也不能说她错了……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:96
translate chinese ch20_main2_bbd414b4:

    # m "And besides, a member's a member, right?"
    m "再说了，成员就是成员嘛，对吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:97
translate chinese ch20_main2_ef8942cb:

    # "...Did Monika say \"she\"?"
    "……莫妮卡刚才说'她'了？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:98
translate chinese ch20_main2_11bedf1c:

    # "Hmm..."
    "唔……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:99
translate chinese ch20_main2_0e946372:

    # m 1a "Hey, [player]..."
    m 1a "对了，[player]……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:100
translate chinese ch20_main2_d5f8d49c:

    # m "By any chance...are you still looking for a club to join?"
    m "该不会……你还在找社团加入吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:101
translate chinese ch20_main2_f9d65918:

    # mc "Ah--"
    mc "啊——"

# script-ch20.rpyc:102
translate chinese ch20_main2_e0a3e98e:

    # mc "I mean, I guess so, but..."
    mc "算是吧，不过……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:103
translate chinese ch20_main2_148978dd:

    # m "In that case..."
    m "这样的话……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:104
translate chinese ch20_main2_6f26aacb:

    # m 5 "Is there any chance you could do me a big favor?"
    m 5 "能不能请你帮我个大忙？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:105
translate chinese ch20_main2_9019334d:

    # m "I won't ask you to join, but..."
    m "我不会求你入部，但是……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:106
translate chinese ch20_main2_cea6fd10:

    # m "If you could at the very least visit my club, it would make me really happy."
    m "哪怕只是来看一眼我的社团，我也会非常开心的。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:107
translate chinese ch20_main2_5b9fdb10:

    # m "Please?"
    m "拜托了？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:108
translate chinese ch20_main2_6b0ed824:

    # mc "Um..."
    mc "唔……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:109
translate chinese ch20_main2_94ea595d:

    # "Well, I guess I have no reason to refuse..."
    "好吧，我好像也没什么理由拒绝……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:110
translate chinese ch20_main2_24dcf38e:

    # "Besides, how could I ever refuse someone like Monika?"
    "况且，莫妮卡这样的女生开口，我又怎么拒绝得了？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:111
translate chinese ch20_main2_a6ec6469:

    # mc "Sure, I guess I could check it out."
    mc "行吧，我可以去看看。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:112
translate chinese ch20_main2_31c2f59c:

    # m 1k "Aah, awesome!"
    m 1k "哇，太棒了！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:113
translate chinese ch20_main2_7f15368b:

    # m 1b "You're really sweet, [player], you know that?"
    m 1b "你真是个好人，[player]，知道吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:114
translate chinese ch20_main2_4e43723a:

    # mc "I-It's nothing, really..."
    mc "没、没什么大不了的……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:115
translate chinese ch20_main2_df96810e:

    # m 1a "Shall we go, then?"
    m 1a "那我们现在就走吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:116
translate chinese ch20_main2_b21a8ccf:

    # m "I'll look for the materials another time - you're more important."
    m "东西下次再找——你比较重要。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:123
translate chinese ch20_main2_fe6b0db2:

    # "And thus, today marks the day I sold my soul to Monika and her irresistible smile."
    "就这样，今天成了我把灵魂出卖给莫妮卡和她那无法抗拒的笑容的日子。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:124
translate chinese ch20_main2_ab62062b:

    # "I timidly follow Monika across the school and upstairs - a section of the school I rarely visit, being generally used for third-year classes and activities."
    "我小心翼翼地跟着莫妮卡穿过校园、走上教学楼高层——这一带主要供三年级上课和开展活动，我很少来。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:125
translate chinese ch20_main2_b2195ace:

    # "Monika, full of energy, swings open the classroom door."
    "莫妮卡元气满满地一把推开了教室的门。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:135
translate chinese ch20_main2_33f9b307:

    # m "I'm back~!"
    m "我回来啦~！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:136
translate chinese ch20_main2_9e0a9684:

    # m "And I brought a guest with me!"
    m "还带回了一位客人！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:140
translate chinese ch20_main2_444e7092:

    # y "Eh?"
    y "诶？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:141
translate chinese ch20_main2_d52d2254:

    # y "A...a guest?"
    y "客……客人？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:143
translate chinese ch20_main2_cc7dab55:

    # n "Seriously? You brought a boy?"
    n "不是吧？你带了个男的来？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:144
translate chinese ch20_main2_2bfb1f2f:

    # n "Way to kill the atmosphere."
    n "气氛全没了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:146
translate chinese ch20_main2_cef21d6a:

    # m "Don't be mean, Natsuki..."
    m "别那么凶嘛，夏树……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:147
translate chinese ch20_main2_e6485931:

    # m 3b "...But anyway, welcome to the club, [player]!"
    m 3b "……总之，欢迎来到文学部，[player]！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:149
translate chinese ch20_main2_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:150
translate chinese ch20_main2_00244a6d:

    # "All words escape me in this situation."
    "此情此景，我说不出话来。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:151
translate chinese ch20_main2_7903e6e7:

    # "This club..."
    "这个社团……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:152
translate chinese ch20_main2_4c13a14b:

    # "{i}...is full of incredibly cute girls!!{/i}"
    "{i}……全是超可爱的女孩子！！{/i}"

# script-ch20.rpyc:155
translate chinese ch20_main2_5dd39c1a:

    # n 5c "So, let me guess..."
    n 5c "让我猜猜……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:156
translate chinese ch20_main2_9d91e589:

    # n "You're Monika's boyfriend, right?"
    n "你是莫妮卡的男朋友，对吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:158
translate chinese ch20_main2_109fa1ce:

    # mc "Wha--"
    mc "什——"

# script-ch20.rpyc:159
translate chinese ch20_main2_3dc221a5:

    # mc "No, I'm not!"
    mc "不，不是！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:161
translate chinese ch20_main2_36e4566e:

    # y 2l "Natsuki..."
    y 2l "夏树……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:163
translate chinese ch20_main2_3b270b09:

    # "The girl with the sour attitude, whose name is apparently Natsuki, is one I don't recognize."
    "这个态度冲人的女孩似乎叫夏树，我并不认识她。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:164
translate chinese ch20_main2_5e0f976f:

    # "Her small figure makes me think she's probably a first-year."
    "看她个子小小的，大概是一年级吧。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:168
translate chinese ch20_main2_95b17045:

    # m 2l "A-Anyway, this is Natsuki, energetic as usual..."
    m 2l "总、总之，这位是夏树，一如既往的活力满满……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:169
translate chinese ch20_main2_204e7b10:

    # m 2b "And this is Yuri, the Vice President!"
    m 2b "这位是优里，副部长！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:173
translate chinese ch20_main2_de6dffcc:

    # y 4 "I-It's nice to meet you..."
    y 4 "初、初次见面……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:174
translate chinese ch20_main2_73e961d1:

    # "Yuri, who appears comparably more mature and timid, seems to have a hard time keeping up with someone like Natsuki."
    "优里看起来相对成熟内向，似乎很难跟上夏树那样的节奏。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:176
translate chinese ch20_main2_273d4c55:

    # mc "Yeah... It's nice to meet both of you."
    mc "嗯……总之，很高兴认识你们两位。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:178
translate chinese ch20_main2_d5adce07:

    # m 1a "So, I ran into [player] in a classroom, and he decided to come check out the club."
    m 1a "是这样的，我在教室里碰到了[player]，他决定来看看我们社团。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:179
translate chinese ch20_main2_bcaaba8c:

    # m "Isn't that great?"
    m "这不是很好吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:182
translate chinese ch20_main2_0e88f1eb:

    # n 4e "Wait! Monika!"
    n 4e "等等！莫妮卡！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:183
translate chinese ch20_main2_d321684b:

    # n "Didn't I tell you to let me know in advance before you brought anyone new?"
    n "我不是说过带新人来之前要提前跟我打招呼吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:184
translate chinese ch20_main2_36775efa:

    # n 4q "I was going to...well, you know..."
    n 4q "我本来打算……你懂的……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:187
translate chinese ch20_main2_f537036e:

    # m 1e "Sorry, sorry!"
    m 1e "抱歉抱歉！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:188
translate chinese ch20_main2_9b8367fd:

    # m "I didn't forget that, but I just happened to run into him."
    m "我没忘这茬，只是碰巧遇上了他嘛。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:191
translate chinese ch20_main2_0fed35e5:

    # y 1a "In that case, I should at least make some tea, right?"
    y 1a "这样的话，我至少该去泡壶茶，对吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:194
translate chinese ch20_main2_fe32ff21:

    # m 1b "Yeah, that would be great!"
    m 1b "嗯，那再好不过了！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:195
translate chinese ch20_main2_7df2370c:

    # m "Why don't you come sit down, [player]?"
    m "快过来坐吧，[player]？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:200
translate chinese ch20_main2_9f8ec8cb:

    # "The girls have a few desks arranged to form a table."
    "女孩们把几张课桌拼成了一张大桌。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:201
translate chinese ch20_main2_dd548a27:

    # "Yuri walks to the corner of the room and opens the closet."
    "优里走向活动室角落，打开了柜子。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:202
translate chinese ch20_main2_7bc19a0f:

    # "Meanwhile, Monika and Natsuki sit across from each other."
    "另一边，莫妮卡和夏树面对面坐了下来。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:203
translate chinese ch20_main2_26f03535:

    # "Still feeling awkward, I take a seat next to Monika."
    "我带着几分拘谨，在莫妮卡身旁坐下。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:205
translate chinese ch20_main2_f7bd3d65:

    # m "So, I know you didn't really plan on coming here..."
    m "我知道，你本来并没打算来这里……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:206
translate chinese ch20_main2_774dba28:

    # m "But we'll make sure you feel right at home, okay?"
    m "但我们会让你有宾至如归的感觉，好吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:207
translate chinese ch20_main2_3f9e20f6:

    # m 1j "As president of the Literature Club, it's my duty to make the club fun and exciting for everyone!"
    m 1j "作为文学部的部长，让部里的每个人都能玩得开心尽兴，就是我的职责！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:208
translate chinese ch20_main2_f2f7dc32:

    # mc "I'm surprised there aren't more people in the club yet."
    mc "部里到现在还没什么人，我有点意外。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:209
translate chinese ch20_main2_d49bb743:

    # mc "It must be hard to start a new club."
    mc "创办新社团想必不容易吧。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:210
translate chinese ch20_main2_be7ec00e:

    # m 3b "You could put it that way."
    m 3b "可以这么说。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:211
translate chinese ch20_main2_75b36957:

    # m "Not many people are very interested in putting out all the effort to start something brand new..."
    m "没多少人愿意费尽心力，去开创一个全新的东西……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:212
translate chinese ch20_main2_e8c57f75:

    # m "Especially when it's something that doesn't grab your attention, like literature."
    m "更何况是文学这种乍看之下吸引不了眼球的东西。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:213
translate chinese ch20_main2_1ca5227d:

    # m "You have to work hard to convince people that you're both fun and worthwhile."
    m "你必须努力让别人相信，这个社团既有乐趣又有价值。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:214
translate chinese ch20_main2_2d2540fa:

    # m "But it makes school events, like the festival, that much more important."
    m "但也正因如此，学园祭这样的校园活动才显得格外重要。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:215
translate chinese ch20_main2_5d278e4b:

    # m 2k "I'm confident that we can all really grow this club before we graduate!"
    m 2k "我有信心，在毕业之前，我们一定能让文学部发展壮大！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:216
translate chinese ch20_main2_6648f9f1:

    # m "Right, Natsuki?"
    m "对吧，夏树？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:219
translate chinese ch20_main2_228e3b68:

    # n "Well..."
    n "唔……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:220
translate chinese ch20_main2_b6f6d9e1:

    # n "...I guess."
    n "……算是吧。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:221
translate chinese ch20_main2_c40dd420:

    # "Natsuki reluctantly agrees."
    "夏树老大不情愿地应和着。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:222
translate chinese ch20_main2_fffaaae6:

    # "Such different girls, all interested in the same goal..."
    "性格迥异的女孩们，却怀着同一个目标……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:223
translate chinese ch20_main2_76b88d58:

    # "Monika must have worked really hard just to find these two."
    "莫妮卡为了聚集起这两个人，一定付出了很多努力。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:224
translate chinese ch20_main2_28adc331:

    # "Yuri returns to the table, carrying a tea set."
    "优里端着一套茶具回到桌边。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:225
translate chinese ch20_main2_356ce113:

    # "She carefully places a teacup in front of each of us before setting down the teapot in the middle."
    "She carefully places a teacup in front of each of us before setting down the teapot in the middle."

# script-ch20.rpyc:231
translate chinese ch20_main2_b0102204:

    # mc "You keep a whole tea set in this classroom?"
    mc "你们在活动室里备了一整套茶具？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:232
translate chinese ch20_main2_63fe0000:

    # y "Don't worry, the teachers gave us permission."
    y "请放心，这是征得老师们同意的。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:233
translate chinese ch20_main2_efc4ed34:

    # y "After all, doesn't a hot cup of tea help you enjoy a good book?"
    y "毕竟，一杯热茶不是更能让人享受阅读的乐趣吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:234
translate chinese ch20_main2_a3a3b943:

    # mc "Ah... I-I guess..."
    mc "啊……也、也是……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:236
translate chinese ch20_main2_de8b3252:

    # m "Ehehe, don't let yourself get intimidated, Yuri's just trying to impress you."
    m "呵呵，别被吓到啦，优里只是想给你留下好印象而已。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:239
translate chinese ch20_main2_d1e9e5c9:

    # y 3n "Eh?! T-That's not..."
    y 3n "诶？！才、才不是……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:240
translate chinese ch20_main2_6f8e7fc9:

    # "Insulted, Yuri looks away."
    "优里像是受了冒犯，移开了视线。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:241
translate chinese ch20_main2_0403ff06:

    # y 4b "I meant that, you know..."
    y 4b "我的本意是……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:243
translate chinese ch20_main2_03220b59:

    # mc "I believe you."
    mc "我相信你。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:244
translate chinese ch20_main2_e29518b6:

    # mc "Well, tea and reading might not be a pastime for me, but I at least enjoy tea."
    mc "虽然品茶读书算不上我的爱好，但至少茶我还是喜欢的。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:246
translate chinese ch20_main2_fb4dad3b:

    # y 2u "I'm glad..."
    y 2u "那就好……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:248
translate chinese ch20_main2_c171e465:

    # "Yuri faintly smiles to herself in relief."
    "优里像是松了口气，独自浅浅一笑。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:252
translate chinese ch20_main2_63db5da7:

    # y "So, [player], what kinds of things do you like to read?"
    y "对了，[player]，你平时喜欢读些什么书呢？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:253
translate chinese ch20_main2_cf79ccdb:

    # mc "Well... Ah..."
    mc "这个……啊……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:254
translate chinese ch20_main2_5fcc5273:

    # "Considering how little I've read these past few years, I don't really have a good way of answering that."
    "考虑到这几年几乎没读过什么书，我实在不知该怎么回答。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:255
translate chinese ch20_main2_1947382b:

    # mc "...Manga..."
    mc "……漫画……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:256
translate chinese ch20_main2_459c1918:

    # "I mutter quietly to myself, half-joking."
    "我半开玩笑地小声嘀咕。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:258
translate chinese ch20_main2_c6e48974:

    # "Natsuki's head suddenly perks up."
    "夏树的头猛地抬了起来。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:259
translate chinese ch20_main2_9101cacb:

    # "It looks like she wants to say something, but she keeps quiet."
    "她似乎想说什么，但还是忍住了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:262
translate chinese ch20_main2_8c105e2a:

    # y 3u "N-Not much of a reader, I guess..."
    y 3u "看、看来平时不怎么读书呢……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:263
translate chinese ch20_main2_68d50b2d:

    # mc "...Well, that can change..."
    mc "……嘛，这也是可以改变的……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:264
translate chinese ch20_main2_ccf38a3c:

    # "What am I saying?"
    "我在说什么啊？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:265
translate chinese ch20_main2_3b4ce5c9:

    # "I spoke without thinking after seeing Yuri's sad smile."
    "看到优里落寞的神情，我竟不假思索地说出了口。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:266
translate chinese ch20_main2_ca4f61b8:

    # mc "Anyway, what about you, Yuri?"
    mc "总之，你呢，优里？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:267
translate chinese ch20_main2_a89289a8:

    # y 1l "Well, let's see..."
    y 1l "这个，我想想……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:268
translate chinese ch20_main2_de0357e1:

    # "Yuri traces the rim of her teacup with her finger."
    "优里的手指沿着杯沿轻轻划动。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:269
translate chinese ch20_main2_17dec8ac:

    # y 1a "My favorites are usually novels that build deep and complex fantasy worlds."
    y 1a "我最喜欢的，通常是那些构建出深邃复杂幻想世界的小说。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:270
translate chinese ch20_main2_24dcace1:

    # y "The level of creativity and craftsmanship behind them is amazing to me."
    y "其中蕴含的创造力与写作功力，总令我叹为观止。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:271
translate chinese ch20_main2_ff3c844f:

    # y 1f "And telling a good story in such a foreign world is equally impressive."
    y 1f "而在那样一个陌生的世界里讲好一个故事，同样了不起。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:272
translate chinese ch20_main2_c77e0dd8:

    # "Yuri goes on, clearly passionate about her reading."
    "优里继续说着，显然对读书满怀热忱。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:273
translate chinese ch20_main2_30d11e87:

    # "She seemed so reserved and timid since the moment I walked in, but it's obvious by the way her eyes light up that she finds her comfort in the world of books, not people."
    "从我进门起她就显得拘谨怕生，可此刻她眼中放出的光芒明白地告诉我：她的归宿在书的世界，而非人的世界。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:274
translate chinese ch20_main2_830d7316:

    # y 2m "But you know, I like a lot of things."
    y 2m "不过，我喜欢的东西其实很多。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:275
translate chinese ch20_main2_7aa57972:

    # y "Stories with deep psychological elements usually immerse me as well."
    y "带有深刻心理描写的作品，也常常令我沉醉其中。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:276
translate chinese ch20_main2_b1a75737:

    # y 2a "Isn't it amazing how a writer can so deliberately take advantage of your own lack of imagination to completely throw you for a loop?"
    y 2a "作者能如此处心积虑地利用你想象力的空白，把你耍得团团转——这难道不奇妙吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:277
translate chinese ch20_main2_98f09acd:

    # y "Anyway, I've been reading a lot of horror lately..."
    y "总之，我最近读了不少恐怖小说……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:278
translate chinese ch20_main2_b274f53a:

    # mc "Ah, I read a horror book once..."
    mc "啊，我也读过一本恐怖的……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:279
translate chinese ch20_main2_e7c359a6:

    # "I desperately grasp something I can relate to at the minimal level."
    "我拼命抓住一个勉强能扯上关系的例子。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:280
translate chinese ch20_main2_6b8ceb25:

    # "At this rate, Yuri might as well be having a conversation with a rock."
    "再这么下去，优里简直是在跟一块石头对话了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:282
translate chinese ch20_main2_d407ea82:

    # m "Ahaha. I'd expect that from you, Yuri."
    m "啊哈，果然是你的风格呢，优里。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:283
translate chinese ch20_main2_8ae45235:

    # m 1a "It suits your personality."
    m 1a "很符合你的气质。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:286
translate chinese ch20_main2_17c1f817:

    # y 1a "Oh, is that so?"
    y 1a "哦，是吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:287
translate chinese ch20_main2_c853c8f6:

    # y "Really, if a story makes me think, or takes me to another world, then I really can't put it down."
    y "真的，只要一个故事能让我思考，或是带我去往另一个世界，我就怎么也放不下了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:288
translate chinese ch20_main2_fa55ff2a:

    # y "Surreal horror is often very successful at changing the way you look at the world, if only for a brief moment."
    y "超现实恐怖作品往往很擅长改变你看待世界的方式——哪怕只是短短一瞬。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:291
translate chinese ch20_main2_b8c3c144:

    # n "Ugh, I hate horror..."
    n "呃，我最讨厌恐怖了……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:294
translate chinese ch20_main2_1c139e48:

    # y 1f "Oh? Why's that?"
    y 1f "哦？为什么呢？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:297
translate chinese ch20_main2_ab1562c5:

    # n 5c "Well, I just..."
    n 5c "就、就是……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:298
translate chinese ch20_main2_7aac067b:

    # "Natsuki's eyes dart over to me for a split second."
    "夏树的视线在一瞬间扫向了我。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:299
translate chinese ch20_main2_98c7c1c1:

    # n 5q "Never mind."
    n 5q "没什么。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:302
translate chinese ch20_main2_5d936510:

    # m 1a "That's right, you usually like to write about cute things, don't you, Natsuki?"
    m 1a "对了，夏树写的东西通常都很可爱，对吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:305
translate chinese ch20_main2_f053d184:

    # n "W-What?"
    n "什、什么？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:306
translate chinese ch20_main2_3df32e44:

    # n "What gives you that idea?"
    n "你为什么这么想？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:309
translate chinese ch20_main2_550dd777:

    # m 3b "You left a piece of scrap paper behind last club meeting."
    m 3b "上次部活的时候，你落了一张草稿纸。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:310
translate chinese ch20_main2_e37f3c62:

    # m "It looked like you were working on a poem called--"
    m "上面好像是一首诗，标题是——"

# script-ch20.rpyc:313
translate chinese ch20_main2_1e455dfe:

    # n "Don't say it out loud!!"
    n "不许念出来！！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:314
translate chinese ch20_main2_ff703620:

    # n "And give that back!"
    n "还有，把它还给我！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:317
translate chinese ch20_main2_7ae96939:

    # m 1j "Fine, fine~"
    m 1j "好好~"

# script-ch20.rpyc:319
translate chinese ch20_main2_af8472c2:

    # mc "Natsuki, you write your own poems?"
    mc "夏树，你自己写诗吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:321
translate chinese ch20_main2_30d37f9a:

    # n 1c "Eh? Well, I guess sometimes."
    n 1c "诶？偶尔写写吧。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:322
translate chinese ch20_main2_842dce39:

    # n "Why do you care?"
    n "你问这个干嘛？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:324
translate chinese ch20_main2_fe27eb16:

    # mc "I think that's impressive."
    mc "我觉得挺厉害的。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:325
translate chinese ch20_main2_ccafd1bb:

    # mc "Why don't you share them sometime?"
    mc "要不要找机会给大家看看？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:327
translate chinese ch20_main2_3f199bd2:

    # n 5q "N-No!"
    n 5q "不、不行！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:328
translate chinese ch20_main2_edb6ed7f:

    # "Natsuki averts her eyes."
    "夏树移开了视线。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:329
translate chinese ch20_main2_9d7b9bad:

    # n "You wouldn't...like them..."
    n "你们不会……喜欢的……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:331
translate chinese ch20_main2_35a5aeea:

    # mc "Ah...not a very confident writer yet?"
    mc "啊……对自己写的东西还没什么自信？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:333
translate chinese ch20_main2_68312196:

    # y 2f "I understand how Natsuki feels."
    y 2f "我明白夏树的感受。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:334
translate chinese ch20_main2_a387c89f:

    # y "Sharing that level of writing takes more than just confidence."
    y "要把那样私密的作品示人，需要的可不只是自信。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:335
translate chinese ch20_main2_e06ca773:

    # y 2k "The truest form of writing is writing to oneself."
    y 2k "最真实的文字，是写给自己的文字。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:336
translate chinese ch20_main2_d2b7c428:

    # y "You must be willing to open up to your readers, exposing your vulnerabilities and showing even the deepest reaches of your heart."
    y "你必须甘愿向读者敞开自己，暴露自己的软肋，甚至展示内心最深处的角落。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:339
translate chinese ch20_main2_d526bbf0:

    # m "Do you have writing experience too, Yuri?"
    m "优里也有写作经验吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:340
translate chinese ch20_main2_2bc6a16e:

    # m "Maybe if you share some of your work, you can set an example and help Natsuki feel comfortable enough to share hers."
    m "要不你也分享一些自己的作品，带个头，让夏树也能安心拿出她的诗。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:342
translate chinese ch20_main2_5a6499dc:

    # y 3o "..."
    y 3o "……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:343
translate chinese ch20_main2_19552c38:

    # mc "I guess it's the same for Yuri..."
    mc "看来优里也一样……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:344
translate chinese ch20_main2_701e440d:

    # "We all sit in silence for a moment."
    "一时间，大家都沉默了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:346
translate chinese ch20_main2_fdf041b5:

    # m 5a "Hey, I just got an idea!"
    m 5a "对了，我想到一个主意！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:347
translate chinese ch20_main2_005c60ce:

    # m "How about this?"
    m "这样如何？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:351
translate chinese ch20_main2_95cd0d51:

    # ny "...?"
    ny "……？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:352
translate chinese ch20_main2_d080e0ca:

    # "Natsuki and Yuri look quizzically at Monika."
    "夏树和优里一脸疑惑地看向莫妮卡。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:356
translate chinese ch20_main2_a4f63044:

    # m 2b "Let's all go home and write a poem of our own!"
    m 2b "我们各自回家，写一首自己的诗吧！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:357
translate chinese ch20_main2_cd1a6280:

    # m "Then, next time we meet, we'll all share them with each other."
    m "等下次见面，大家互相分享。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:358
translate chinese ch20_main2_a106107a:

    # m "That way, everyone is even!"
    m "这样谁都不会不好意思了！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:361
translate chinese ch20_main2_963b3971:

    # n 5q "U-Um..."
    n 5q "那、那个……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:364
translate chinese ch20_main2_71a86863:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:367
translate chinese ch20_main2_f0139694:

    # m "Ah..."
    m "啊……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:368
translate chinese ch20_main2_9b894fcc:

    # m "I mean, I thought it was a good idea..."
    m "我以为这是个好主意来着……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:371
translate chinese ch20_main2_d2a1aba6:

    # y 2l "Well..."
    y 2l "这个……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:372
translate chinese ch20_main2_1570106e:

    # y "...I think you're right, Monika."
    y "……我觉得你说得对，莫妮卡。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:373
translate chinese ch20_main2_358acf11:

    # y 2f "We should probably start finding activities for all of us to participate in together."
    y 2f "我们确实该开始找一些大家一起参与的活动了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:374
translate chinese ch20_main2_97473fce:

    # y 2h "I did decide to take on the responsibility of Vice President, after all..."
    y 2h "毕竟我既然接受了副部长的职责……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:375
translate chinese ch20_main2_6400d1aa:

    # y "I need to do my best to nurture the club as well as its members."
    y "就该尽全力培育好这个社团和每一位成员。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:376
translate chinese ch20_main2_a515a8b2:

    # y 2a "Besides, now that we have a new member..."
    y 2a "况且，既然来了一位新成员……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:377
translate chinese ch20_main2_6cd4d347:

    # y "It seems like a good step for us to take."
    y "这对我们来说似乎是很好的一步。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:378
translate chinese ch20_main2_d5d48b8f:

    # y "Do you agree as well, [player]?"
    y "你也同意吧，[player]？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:380
translate chinese ch20_main2_cf25d371:

    # mc "Hold on...there's still one problem."
    mc "等等……还有个问题。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:382
translate chinese ch20_main2_bee826cb:

    # m 1d "Eh? What's that?"
    m 1d "诶？什么问题？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:383
translate chinese ch20_main2_d078fb85:

    # "Now that we've reached the most important topic, I bluntly come forth with what's been on my mind the entire time."
    "话题终于来到最关键处，我索性把憋了一路的话直说了出来。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:385
translate chinese ch20_main2_5ce8ccfa:

    # mc "I never said I would join this club!"
    mc "我可从没说过要加入这个社团！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:386
translate chinese ch20_main2_1cb46f5d:

    # mc "Monika may have convinced me to stop by, but I never made any decision."
    mc "莫妮卡只是说服我过来看看，我还没做任何决定。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:387
translate chinese ch20_main2_4de02539:

    # mc "I still have other clubs to look at, and...um..."
    mc "我还要看看别的社团，而且……唔……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:391
translate chinese ch20_main2_1e4b58a1:

    # "I lose my train of thought."
    "我的话头断了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:392
translate chinese ch20_main2_aa92c4c7:

    # "All three girls stare back at me with dejected eyes."
    "All three girls stare back at me with dejected eyes."

# script-ch20.rpyc:394
translate chinese ch20_main2_8911e105:

    # m 1p "B-But..."
    m 1p "可、可是……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:396
translate chinese ch20_main2_a403322e:

    # y 2v "I'm sorry, I thought..."
    y 2v "对不起，我以为……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:398
translate chinese ch20_main2_bc64dbb8:

    # n 5s "Hmph."
    n 5s "哼。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:399
translate chinese ch20_main2_bbe4458e:

    # mc "Eh...?"
    mc "诶……？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:400
translate chinese ch20_main2_d6738775:

    # "The girls exchange glances before Monika turns back to me."
    "The girls exchange glances before Monika turns back to me."

# script-ch20.rpyc:402
translate chinese ch20_main2_6a0c763d:

    # m 1m "I...guess I need to tell you the truth, [player]."
    m 1m "我……大概得跟你说实话了，[player]。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:403
translate chinese ch20_main2_80d67ce2:

    # m "The thing is..."
    m "其实是……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:404
translate chinese ch20_main2_3ecd0ecb:

    # m 1p "...We don't have enough members yet to form an official club."
    m 1p "……我们的人数还不够，成立不了正式社团。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:405
translate chinese ch20_main2_c4b6f680:

    # m "We need four..."
    m "我们需要四个人……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:406
translate chinese ch20_main2_2b9a1be6:

    # m "And I've been trying really, really hard to find new members."
    m "而为了找新成员，我真的、真的非常努力了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:407
translate chinese ch20_main2_9e1492ef:

    # m "And if we don't find one more before the festival..."
    m "如果学园祭之前再找不到一个人……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:409
translate chinese ch20_main2_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:410
translate chinese ch20_main2_966cc463:

    # "I...I'm defenseless against these girls."
    "我……我对这些女孩子毫无招架之力。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:411
translate chinese ch20_main2_d4da3079:

    # "How am I supposed to make a clear-headed decision when it's like this?"
    "这叫人怎么冷静地做决定啊？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:412
translate chinese ch20_main2_ce9e8607:

    # "I would feel terrible for letting everyone down in this situation..."
    "这种情况下让大家失望的话，我会过意不去的……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:413
translate chinese ch20_main2_03c36b6c:

    # "And besides, the club itself seems pretty relaxed..."
    "况且，这个社团本身看起来也相当轻松……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:414
translate chinese ch20_main2_b8826b43:

    # "So, if writing poems is the price I need to pay in order to spend every day with these beautiful girls..."
    "那么，如果写诗就是和这些可爱女孩们共度每一天的代价……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:415
translate chinese ch20_main2_36037676:

    # mc "...Right."
    mc "……好吧。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:416
translate chinese ch20_main2_ee38c6e2:

    # mc "Okay, I've decided, then."
    mc "好，我决定了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:417
translate chinese ch20_main2_bfead9f9:

    # mc "I'll join the Literature Club."
    mc "我加入文学部。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:421
translate chinese ch20_main2_4423eaff:

    # "One by one, the girls' eyes light up."
    "女孩们的眼睛一个个亮了起来。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:423
translate chinese ch20_main2_2833368d:

    # m "Oh my goodness, really?"
    m "天哪，真的吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:424
translate chinese ch20_main2_4967ad00:

    # m "Do you really mean that, [player]?"
    m "你是认真的吗，[player]？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:426
translate chinese ch20_main2_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "嗯……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:427
translate chinese ch20_main2_32db0986:

    # mc "It could be fun, right?"
    mc "说不定会很有意思，对吧？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:429
translate chinese ch20_main2_792dfef8:

    # y 1m "You really did scare me for a moment..."
    y 1m "刚才真的吓了我一跳……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:432
translate chinese ch20_main2_0cada34f:

    # n 5q "I mean, if you really just left after all this, I would be super pissed."
    n 5q "就是说，要是你都到这一步了还拍屁股走人，我会超级火大。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:435
translate chinese ch20_main2_28ffefdc:

    # m "[player], I'm so happy..."
    m "[player]，我太开心了……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:436
translate chinese ch20_main2_ef0e1a2a:

    # m 1k "We can become an official club now!"
    m 1k "我们现在可以成为正式社团了！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:437
translate chinese ch20_main2_f0a88022:

    # m 1e "Thank you so much for this. You're really amazing."
    m 1e "真的太谢谢你了。你真的太好了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:438
translate chinese ch20_main2_33324090:

    # m "I'll do everything I can to give you a great time, okay?"
    m "我会竭尽全力让你在这里玩得开心，好吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:440
translate chinese ch20_main2_fc5c3668:

    # mc "Ah...thanks, I guess."
    mc "啊……总之，谢了。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:446
translate chinese ch20_main2_e719ebca:

    # m 3b "Okay, everyone!"
    m 3b "好了，各位！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:447
translate chinese ch20_main2_94ecc185:

    # m "I think with that, we can officially end today's meeting on a good note."
    m "我想，今天的活动就可以圆满结束啦。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:448
translate chinese ch20_main2_435b8f44:

    # m "Everyone remember tonight's assignment:"
    m "大家别忘了今晚的作业："

# script-ch20.rpyc:449
translate chinese ch20_main2_f3222edc:

    # m "Write a poem to bring to the next meeting, so we can all share!"
    m "写一首诗带来，下次一起分享！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:450
translate chinese ch20_main2_f7602550:

    # "Monika looks over at me once more."
    "莫妮卡又看了我一眼。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:451
translate chinese ch20_main2_7c3950aa:

    # m 1a "[player], I look forward to seeing how you express yourself."
    m 1a "[player]，我很期待看到你会如何表达自己。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:453
translate chinese ch20_main2_45d9cd96:

    # m "Ehehe~"
    m "呵呵~"

# script-ch20.rpyc:454
translate chinese ch20_main2_5aa72ccd:

    # mc "Y-Yeah..."
    mc "嗯、嗯……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:457
translate chinese ch20_main2_c5a873f7:

    # "Can I really impress the class star Monika with my mediocre writing skills?"
    "就我这半吊子的文笔，真能让年级红人莫妮卡刮目相看吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:458
translate chinese ch20_main2_6944e055:

    # "I already feel the anxiety welling up inside me."
    "不安已经开始在我心里翻涌。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:459
translate chinese ch20_main2_00553df6:

    # "Meanwhile, the girls continue to chit-chat as Yuri cleans up the tea set."
    "另一边，优里收拾着茶具，女孩们继续闲聊。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:460
translate chinese ch20_main2_19cf7098:

    # mc "I guess I'll be on my way, then..."
    mc "那我就先走了……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:462
translate chinese ch20_main2_e74385d7:

    # m "Okay!"
    m "好！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:463
translate chinese ch20_main2_120cd030:

    # m "I'll see you tomorrow, then."
    m "那明天见啦。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:464
translate chinese ch20_main2_d9382816:

    # m "I can't wait!"
    m "真是等不及了！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:469
translate chinese ch20_main2_6afc1118:

    # "With that, I depart the clubroom and make my way home."
    "就这样，我离开活动室，踏上回家的路。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:470
translate chinese ch20_main2_922e4616:

    # "The whole way, my mind wanders back and forth between the three girls:"
    "一路上，我的思绪在三个女孩之间来回游走："

# script-ch20.rpyc:472
translate chinese ch20_main2_fa99dc55:

    # "Natsuki,"
    "夏树，"

# script-ch20.rpyc:474
translate chinese ch20_main2_f8ee4cf6:

    # "Yuri,"
    "优里，"

# script-ch20.rpyc:476
translate chinese ch20_main2_b3c6e50b:

    # "and, of course, Monika."
    "还有，当然，莫妮卡。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:477
translate chinese ch20_main2_3ec099e1:

    # "Will I really be happy spending every day after school in a literature club?"
    "每天放学后都泡在文学部里，我真的会幸福吗？"

# script-ch20.rpyc:478
translate chinese ch20_main2_2b5dfb83:

    # "Perhaps I'll have the chance to grow closer to one of these girls..."
    "说不定，我还有机会和其中某个人走得更近……"

# script-ch20.rpyc:483
translate chinese ch20_main2_16cd82b1:

    # "Alright!"
    "好了！"

# script-ch20.rpyc:484
translate chinese ch20_main2_b0188844:

    # "I'll just need to make the most of my circumstances, and I'm sure good fortune will find me."
    "只要充分利用眼前的处境，好运一定会找上门来。"

# script-ch20.rpyc:485
translate chinese ch20_main2_dff2799d:

    # "And I guess that starts with writing a poem tonight..."
    "而这一切，就从今晚写一首诗开始吧……"

